@host = http://localhost:5240

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Categories
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### Products
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Low stock
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/low-stock

### Expiring within 30 days
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/expiring?days=30

### Dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard

### AI POC - low stock
POST {{host}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What should I reorder?"
}
